{"type":"Feature","properties":{"kind":"anchorage","name":"Nordwest-Reede","approach":"west","osm":["way/184070450"],"source":"OpenStreetMap way 184070450","licence":"ODbL-1.0","reviewed_at":"2026-11-24","note":"Seamark anchorage off Brunsbüttel, west of the canal entrance. The Bekanntmachung zur Seeschifffahrtsstraßen-Ordnung (BAnz AT 31.01.2014 B7, No. 17.2.4) lets only ships due to lock into the next free lock use it. OpenStreetMap draws it as an open line along the fairway's northern edge, from buoy 58a (NOK 2 Reede) towards the entrance, so the area is that line grown by 300 m."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[9.072256,53.877917],[9.072605,53.876885],[9.073597,53.876009],[9.075082,53.875424],[9.076833,53.875219],[9.078584,53.875424],[9.117202,53.880157],[9.118687,53.880742],[9.128803,53.885537],[9.129795,53.886413],[9.130144,53.887445],[9.129795,53.888477],[9.128803,53.889353],[9.127318,53.889938],[9.125566,53.890143],[9.123814,53.889938],[9.075082,53.88041],[9.073597,53.879825],[9.072605,53.878949],[9.072256,53.877917]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"kind":"anchorage","name":"Anchorage","approach":"east","osm":["way/140480375"],"source":"OpenStreetMap way 140480375","licence":"ODbL-1.0","reviewed_at":"2026-11-24","note":"Seamark anchorage with no name in OpenStreetMap, in the Kiel Fjord off the Holtenau locks: the Holtenau-Reede. The Bekanntmachung zur Seeschifffahrtsstraßen-Ordnung (BAnz AT 31.01.2014 B7, No. 17.3.1) keeps it for ships waiting to lock, for a berth in the port of Kiel or for better weather. The gem has no outline for the port of Kiel; limits for it that take in the roadstead would have to give it up."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[10.160012,54.368759],[10.170617,54.369238],[10.187983,54.385467],[10.179017,54.385467],[10.170187,54.37906],[10.160012,54.368759]]]}},
